          "type": "ai_gen_block_183bc97",
          "settings": {
            "custom_html": "<!-- ================= SECTION 1 — MADE FOR EVERY SKIN ================= -->\n<div style=\"background:#efefe9;color:#121212;padding:clamp(56px,9vw,110px) clamp(20px,5vw,48px);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:clamp(24px,3.4vw,40px);\">\n\n    <h2 style=\"\n      margin:0;\n      color:#121212;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,64px);\n      line-height:0.95;\n    \">\n      Made for every skin\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"\n      margin:0;\n      max-width:56ch;\n      font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.0625rem);\n      line-height:1.7;\n      color:#544541;\n    \">\n      Everyone has a biome. Wherever your skin is today, it has a foundation worth supporting.\n      What’s Your Biome Step<span style=\"font-size:0.62em;letter-spacing:0;vertical-align:0.55em;\">™</span>?\n    </p>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;\">\n\n      <span style=\"border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#121212;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        Every age\n      </span>\n\n      <span style=\"border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#121212;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        Every tone\n      </span>\n\n      <span style=\"border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#121212;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        Every type\n      </span>\n\n      <span style=\"border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#121212;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        Every routine\n      </span>\n\n      <span style=\"border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#121212;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        Every day\n      </span>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"background:#efefe9;padding:clamp(64px,10vw,160px) 0;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,64px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(36px,6vw,88px);align-items:flex-start;\">\n \n    <div style=\"flex:1 1 380px;min-width:280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:clamp(20px,2.6vw,30px);padding-top:clamp(0px,3vw,56px);\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6f655e;\">The Biome Step<span style=\"font-size:0.72em;letter-spacing:0;vertical-align:0.5em;\">™</span>\n</div>\n      <h2 style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7.2vw,6rem);line-height:0.88;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#121212;\">What’s your biome step<span style=\"font-size:0.16em;letter-spacing:0;vertical-align:3.9em;line-height:1;margin-left:0.08em;\">™</span>?</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;max-width:42ch;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.0625rem);line-height:1.75;color:#544541;\">Every routine already includes cleansing and moisturizing. Now add your biome. Nourish your biome, and build resilient skin from the biome up.</p>\n      <div>\n        <a href=\"https://sivcare.com/products/siv-biome-balancing-serum\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#121212;color:#efefe9;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 30px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;\">Nourish your biome</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n \n    <div style=\"flex:1 1 420px;min-width:280px;position:relative;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/1315/6923/files/lifestyle_face_biome.jpg?v=1788882854\" alt=\"Luminous skin traced with a gold molecular network\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(380px,68vh,820px);object-fit:cover;\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:-16px;bottom:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);background:#121212;color:#efefe9;padding:20px 26px;max-width:24ch;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:0.03em;color:#efefe9;\">After toning</h3>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.55;color:#d7d2cb;\">One to three drops, once a day, patted into dry or damp skin.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n \n  </div>\n</div>",
